{"speciesId":815,"names":{"fr":"Pyrobut","es":"Cinderace","en":"Cinderace","ja":"エースバーン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il drible avec des pierres pour en faire des ballons enflammés, avant de tirer sur ses adversaires pour les brûler."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Convierte piedras en balones de fuego dándoles toques y, luego, chuta con fuerza hacia el rival para chamuscarlo."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It juggles a pebble with its feet, turning it into a burning soccer ball. Its shots strike opponents hard and leave them scorched."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"小石を リフティングして 炎の サッカーボールを つくる。 するどい シュートで 相手を 燃やす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Exceptionnel en attaque comme en défense, il s’exalte quand on l’encourage, mais il lui arrive de se mettre en danger en jouant solo."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Destaca tanto en ataque como en defensa. Se crece cuando recibe una ovación, pero a veces se luce tanto que termina viéndose en apuros."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It’s skilled at both offense and defense, and it gets pumped up when cheered on. But if it starts showboating, it could put itself in a tough spot."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"攻守に 優れ 応援されると さらに 燃えるが スタンドプレイに 走り ピンチを 招くこともある。"}],"varieties":[{"id":815,"moves":[{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-kick","learns":[[20,"level-up",12],[25,"level-up",12]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[20,"level-up",30],[25,"level-up",30]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[20,"level-up",54],[25,"level-up",54],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"growl","learns":[[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1